I`ve coded this in a day... Blitz Basic!


:: iNStALLAtiON ::-------------------------------------------------------

Simply follow these steps:

1. The door MUST be in a dir called TERBO located in DOORS
2. Move the files welcome.gfx and welcome.txt to doors:terbo/
3. Create 2 files called quick.gfx and quick.txt that contains stuff
   that you want to force the user to see, and save these to doors:terbo/
4. Edit your frontends.dat so that the last line reads

	doors:terbo/terbo %N

5. Thats it!

HOW IT WORKS

When a user logs in, they are asked if they want to Quick login.
If they say yes, then the files quick.gfx and quick.txt are copied 
to daydream:display/iso/welcome.gfx and 
   daydream:display/iso/welcome.txt

If they say no, then the files welcome.gfx and welcome.txt are copied 
to daydream:display/iso/welcome.gfx and 
   daydream:display/iso/welcome.txt

Simple!

